  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86240,
    "dDurationMs": 4299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relatively small then\nwhy wasn't more done about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90539,
    "dDurationMs": 5068,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BG: Well there's some risks like earthquakes\nwhere we see small earthquakes all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95607,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or you know the history of war or fire or"
