  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115417,
    "dDurationMs": 4811,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one will help us understand it\nneeds to be a priority."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120228,
    "dDurationMs": 3452,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: I feel like humans have an issue though\nwith fighting the last battle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123680,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "potentially, so\nif we focus on pandemics now and there"
