  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127680,
    "dDurationMs": 2019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't one say for another hundred years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129699,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is the next disaster? What is the one that we're not prepared for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134089,
    "dDurationMs": 1637,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BG: Well I'd point out two:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135726,
    "dDurationMs": 1753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is climate change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137479,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every year that would be a death toll"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138800,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even greater than we've had in this\npandemic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142160,
    "dDurationMs": 4079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also, related to pandemics is something\npeople don't like to talk about much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146239,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is bioterrorism, that\nsomebody who wants to cause damage could"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150640,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineer a virus and so that means the cost"
