  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184080,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know yellowstone-like eruption\nand in fact he showed that pandemics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188720,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were significantly\nthe biggest thing other than a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192000,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "human-caused nuclear war\nthat we needed to be more prepared for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197440,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: So what changes do we put in place\nto be readier for the next one and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203200,
    "dDurationMs": 3844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is it possible that covid-19 could be the\nlast global pandemic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207044,
    "dDurationMs": 5436,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BG: Well certainly there will be more pandemics. \nThe ways that humans interact with other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212480,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "species, these viruses are coming across\na species barrier whether it's from bats"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218080,
    "dDurationMs": 2591,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or monkeys or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220671,
    "dDurationMs": 3409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: but you don't think we could increase our preparedness to such\na level that"
