  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224080,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it never sort of becomes this global\nissue?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227280,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BG: We could increase our preparedness so we\nnever have a death toll"
