  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252400,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uh with the right system should be a\ntenth of what we we've seen here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256560,
    "dDurationMs": 4079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: And the systems that you want to put in\nplace so this"
