  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260639,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sort of so you can nip it in the bud or\nso what are the key elements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264000,
    "dDurationMs": 2451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we didn't have that we should have\ngoing forward? "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266451,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BG: I would divide it into two sections:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268318,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's the field based activity and the R\u0026D activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272320,
    "dDurationMs": 5439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In R\u0026D we need to mature mRNA\nso we can make it even faster and have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277759,
    "dDurationMs": 1986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "factories all over the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279745,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have it be cheap and thermal stable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281840,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a lot that can go into\ntherapeutics including antibodies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285440,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On diagnostics having the ability to give"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288560,
    "dDurationMs": 2396,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10 million PCR tests a day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290956,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then in terms of the field we need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292960,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of diagnostic machines all over\nthe world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296320,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need a team of epidemiologists. So the\ninvestments are about equal between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300960,
    "dDurationMs": 7354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "R\u0026D and the the field-based group and information that should beconstantly flowing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308314,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: You know I feel like there's a meta-issue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310560,
    "dDurationMs": 3919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is kind of above\nall of these issues which is you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314479,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way that people connect with\nreality and figure out what's true and"
