  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326720,
    "dDurationMs": 3039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make\nthe correct information so much more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329759,
    "dDurationMs": 5201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "easy to access and\nbring us into a more fact-based world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334960,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead it doesn't look as though it's\nbringing us there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338240,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder if you shared a similar vision\nfor"
