  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576080,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no you must partner exclusively with a\nbig pharma company AstraZeneca"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580560,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so obviously it seems to the people\non twitter that something nefarious was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584000,
    "dDurationMs": 4565,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going on there, but I wanted to know from Bill what was the real story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588565,
    "dDurationMs": 3595,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BG: Well the making a safe vaccine"
