  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596160,
    "dDurationMs": 5119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and people are very picky about\nvaccines in fact you could ruin the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601279,
    "dDurationMs": 3201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reputation of vaccines if you're making\nthem in factories"
