  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750959,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are huge challenges in each of\nthose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754079,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm hopeful that Johnson and Johnson in\nthe next month will get approved because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758639,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's a single dose vaccine,\nvery cheap highly scalable so"
